  "label": "Meme Format of Comparison",
  "description": "The meme uses a common format of juxtaposing two images from different time periods to imply a decline or deterioration. This format is often used to make moral or cultural judgments about the present based on an idealized past, which is a rhetorical device that can be used to reinforce negative stereotypes.",
